      'Solve it with composition rather than an ever-growing prop list where possible — a smaller set of well-defined variants covering the common cases, plus an explicit, sanctioned escape hatch (a slot, a wrapping pattern) for the genuine one-off, so the rare edge case doesn\'t force complexity onto every consumer of the common case.',
